# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit real values.

# --- Neon PostgreSQL (required) --------------------------------------------
# Use the POOLED connection string for the app (it contains "-pooler").
DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:password@ep-xxx-pooler.region.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require

# --- Filebase S3-compatible storage (required for uploads) ------------------
# Filebase → Buckets → Access Keys. The bucket must stay private.
FILEBASE_ACCESS_KEY=
FILEBASE_SECRET_KEY=
FILEBASE_BUCKET=
FILEBASE_ENDPOINT=https://s3.filebase.io
# Filebase recommends "auto"; a wrong region is the top cause of
# SignatureDoesNotMatch. Use us-east-1 only if a tool refuses "auto".
FILEBASE_REGION=auto

# --- Application ------------------------------------------------------------
# Canonical origin, used when building links outside a request.
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

# --- Cleanup function only --------------------------------------------------
# Not used by the web app. Required by neon/functions/cleanup.ts for manual
# invocations; Neon trigger deliveries authenticate by header instead.
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 48
CLEANUP_SECRET=
